flowchart TD
 A[Proposed Tool Call] --> B[Classify Tool Category]
 B --> C[Map to Execution Class]
 C --> D[Check Global Risk Gate]
 D --> E[Check Execution Gate]
 E --> F{Protected Path?}
 F -- yes --> G[Deny or Require Approval]
 F -- no --> H{Command Tool?}
 H -- yes --> I[Command Classifier]
 H -- no --> J[Policy Check]
 I --> J
 J --> K{Approval Required?}
 K -- yes --> L[Approval Request]
 K -- no --> M{Allowed?}
 M -- yes --> N[Run Tool]
 M -- no --> O[Safe Alternative / Stop]
 N --> P[Log + Validate + Report]
